{
  "$comment": [
    "orch hook wiring. Merge into .claude/settings.json, or launch with",
    "  claude --settings settings.json",
    "",
    "SPEC DEVIATION (see README, 'Where the spec and the CLI disagree'): §6.2 of",
    "the overhaul spec calls for the declarative `if` field with permission-rule",
    "syntax, e.g. \"if\": \"Bash(git merge*)\", to pre-filter without spawning a",
    "process. That field does not exist in CLI 2.1.228 — its settings validator",
    "states hooks map event names to matcher arrays carrying string matchers, and",
    "there is no if-condition anywhere in the binary. So the matcher below narrows",
    "to the Bash tool and gate-guard.sh does the command match itself. The cost is",
    "one short-lived process per Bash call; the correctness is identical.",
    "",
    "crossSessionInbound must be `accept` on every session in the team, and every",
    "session must launch in the same permission-mode class — a message across",
    "mismatched classes is held for approval and dropped after dialogExpiry",
    "(default 5m), which is silence, not an error. `orch doctor` checks both."
  ],

  "crossSessionInbound": "accept",

  "hooks": {
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Bash",
        "hooks": [
          { "type": "command", "command": "$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/orch-hooks/gate-guard.sh", "timeout": 10 }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "SendMessage",
        "hooks": [
          { "type": "command", "command": "$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/orch-hooks/audit-message.sh", "timeout": 10 }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "Edit|Write|NotebookEdit|MultiEdit",
        "hooks": [
          { "type": "command", "command": "$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/orch-hooks/write-scope.sh", "timeout": 10 }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "TaskGet|TaskList|TaskUpdate",
        "hooks": [
          { "type": "command", "command": "$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/orch-hooks/task-scope.sh", "timeout": 10 }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "Read|Grep",
        "hooks": [
          { "type": "command", "command": "$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/orch-hooks/artifact-scope.sh", "timeout": 10 }
        ]
      }
    ],

    "PostToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "SendMessage",
        "hooks": [
          { "type": "command", "command": "$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/orch-hooks/audit-message.sh", "timeout": 10 }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "*",
        "hooks": [
          { "type": "command", "command": "$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/orch-hooks/health-probe.sh", "timeout": 10 }
        ]
      }
    ],

    "PostToolUseFailure": [
      {
        "matcher": "*",
        "hooks": [
          { "type": "command", "command": "$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/orch-hooks/health-probe.sh", "timeout": 10 }
        ]
      }
    ],

    "PostCompact": [
      {
        "matcher": "*",
        "hooks": [
          { "type": "command", "command": "$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/orch-hooks/health-probe.sh", "timeout": 10 }
        ]
      }
    ],

    "TaskCompleted": [
      {
        "matcher": "*",
        "hooks": [
          { "type": "command", "command": "$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/orch-hooks/task-guard.sh", "timeout": 15 }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
